  // Log 592 (round over said health 2600 for a node Rare's message 20 had destroyed in that same frame: our property
  // read is up to 1 s old): the power node's charges that went off, counted from its health (each drop of 3000+
  // between two reads is one of Rare's 3700 blasts; gunfire takes far less a second), and the nodes Rare destroyed.
  std::unordered_map<uint32_t, float> g_node_seen_health;
