// sub_82273B50 [controller, f1 dt]: the bot's input controller's per-frame
// update (the controller is embedded in the character at +6284; vtable +80,
// called from the character's input step sub_8252C7E0 at 8252C9C4). It copies
// the pending triggers (+8 / +12, set by char vtable +612 / +616) into the
// current ones (+56 / +60), which the gun's fire step reads (82587A68, over
// 0.8), and clears the pending ones. Rare's use-weapon tasks set the pending
// value every frame from the AI tick; our press from the brain frame lasted
// one frame (log 127), and Rare's task ends at once without a hostile
// character as its target (logs 128-132). Ours: for an attacker whose hold is
